DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Christmas with a tour of beautifully decorated homes in Winters. Benefiting Yolo County seniors and children. \nFriday\, November 20th\, 4PM-7PM \nSaturday\, November 21st\, 10AM-2PM \nTickets are $40 each. Click here to purchase.
